      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Express Bike Transport Courier</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	
	<p>When it comes to transporting your beloved motorcycle, ensuring a safe and hassle-free journey is essential. To facilitate a seamless process, several crucial documents are required for bike transport via courier services. Here's a detailed list of the essential paperwork you need to provide:</p>
	<h3>1. Self-attested RC photocopy</h3>
	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A self-attested copy of the Registration Certificate (RC) is essential to prove ownership and identity of the motorcycle.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Make sure to obtain a clean copy without any stamps or marks to maintain its authenticity.</p>
  </div>
</div>
	<h3>2. Current PUC (<strong>Pollution Under Control</strong>)</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>A valid Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate confirms that the motorcycle meets emission standards and is fit for road usage.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Make sure the PUC is not expired and is up-to-date to avoid any delays or complications during transport.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<h3>3. Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Provide a copy of your valid motorcycle insurance certificate to ensure legal protection during transport.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Ensure that the insurance covers both damage to the motorcycle and any potential liabilities.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<h3>4. IBA-Approved Consignment Bill of Lading</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>An IBA-approved (Indian Bike Association) Consignment Bill of Lading serves as a legal agreement between you and the courier service.</span></li>
