	</ul>
	<h3>5. Important Contact Information</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Provide your complete contact details, including your name, address, and phone number.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Additionally, ensure the courier service has accurate contact information for both the sender and the recipient.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<h3>6. Self-attested Ownership Documentation (If Applicable)</h3>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
